[
  {
    "start": 4.0,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "Woof."
  },
  {
    "start": 5.52,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "It's boob."
  },
  {
    "start": 16.64,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Mondingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 33.68,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "Clark, you sell me it."
  },
  {
    "start": 43.28,
    "duration": 5.12,
    "text": "Welcome back to the channel, Mondingos."
  },
  {
    "start": 46.96,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "That's where we're going for a wild camp"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.4,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "today."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.76,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "Up with Pincham Monument."
  },
  {
    "start": 53.28,
    "duration": 4.72,
    "text": "Quite busy at the minute."
  },
  {
    "start": 55.4,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "A lot of people kicking about."
  },
  {
    "start": 58.0,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "With me"
  },
  {
    "start": 59.44,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "and the little Mondingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 63.44,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "We'll find a good spot."
  },
  {
    "start": 66.92,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Obviously,"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.08,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "we're not going to camp right next to"
  },
  {
    "start": 69.2,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "it."
  },
  {
    "start": 72.56,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "We'll find somewhere just down by the"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.84,
    "duration": 5.04,
    "text": "side."
  },
  {
    "start": 77.08,
    "duration": 5.64,
    "text": "Right. See you at the top."
  },
  {
    "start": 79.88,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "Rights."
  },
  {
    "start": 98.88,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 130.8,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "I was naked, huh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 183.92,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "I'm trying to get a quick little one in."
  },
  {
    "start": 252.64,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "So, we're approaching Penshaw Monument"
  },
  {
    "start": 254.28,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "now, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 256.12,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "We took the longer walk."
  },
  {
    "start": 258.32,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "Most people just park up down at the"
  },
  {
    "start": 260.36,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "bottom"
  },
  {
    "start": 261.48,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "and they walk straight up the front of"
  },
  {
    "start": 262.56,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "it."
  },
  {
    "start": 263.68,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "We've come around the side through the"
  },
  {
    "start": 265.24,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "woods"
  },
  {
    "start": 266.48,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "and up around the back. It's a nicer"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.08,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "walk."
  },
  {
    "start": 270.48,
    "duration": 5.16,
    "text": "Makes it a bit longer"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.76,
    "duration": 2.88,
    "text": "and more enjoyable."
  },
  {
    "start": 277.68,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "Looks like there's still a few people"
  },
  {
    "start": 278.88,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "kicking about."
  },
  {
    "start": 280.48,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "So, we'll just hang around."
  },
  {
    "start": 283.8,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "Have a bit of a mess about with the"
  },
  {
    "start": 284.56,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "camera, take some photos and that."
  },
  {
    "start": 288.56,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "And then, um"
  },
  {
    "start": 290.44,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "look for a spot."
  },
  {
    "start": 292.84,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "Get the cans out, Mick, eh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 294.36,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "Oh, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 295.2,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "Few cans,"
  },
  {
    "start": 296.92,
    "duration": 5.16,
    "text": "few whiskeys."
  },
  {
    "start": 298.68,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "You know the drill, Mandingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 302.2,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "We're only local."
  },
  {
    "start": 303.84,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "If you're wondering where this is,"
  },
  {
    "start": 305.84,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "anyone,"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.52,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "it's in the city of Sunderland. Well, on"
  },
  {
    "start": 309.16,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "the outskirts, but still classed as"
  },
  {
    "start": 311.4,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "Sunderland."
  },
  {
    "start": 314.28,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "And uh"
  },
  {
    "start": 315.12,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "we're very lucky to have this here."
  },
  {
    "start": 318.24,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "I think a few people would be surprised,"
  },
  {
    "start": 319.56,
    "duration": 1.44,
    "text": "Mick."
  },
  {
    "start": 320.6,
    "duration": 1.44,
    "text": "Eh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 321.0,
    "duration": 1.8,
    "text": "I think there's a few people would be"
  },
  {
    "start": 322.04,
    "duration": 1.56,
    "text": "surprised"
  },
  {
    "start": 322.8,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "No."
  },
  {
    "start": 323.6,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "having something like this"
  },
  {
    "start": 325.64,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "in Sunderland."
  },
  {
    "start": 327.64,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about,"
  },
  {
    "start": 329.24,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Mandingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 333.68,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "Yes, Mick, lad."
  },
  {
    "start": 338.64,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "You better believe it, Mick."
  },
  {
    "start": 451.52,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "We're just getting the tent set up,"
  },
  {
    "start": 452.72,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 454.16,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "We've still got to get all of our stuff"
  },
  {
    "start": 456.12,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "put inside."
  },
  {
    "start": 457.68,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "I'll give you a quick look."
  },
  {
    "start": 464.12,
    "duration": 4.44,
    "text": "The monuments are all up. Fantastic."
  },
  {
    "start": 469.36,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "There's the tent."
  },
  {
    "start": 471.32,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "You're not going to get a better spot"
  },
  {
    "start": 472.2,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "than that."
  },
  {
    "start": 482.52,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "Can you spot Mick?"
  },
  {
    "start": 486.12,
    "duration": 5.16,
    "text": "Little Mick's gone in the tent"
  },
  {
    "start": 488.28,
    "duration": 6.28,
    "text": "cuz he's [\u00a0__\u00a0] scared of cows."
  },
  {
    "start": 491.28,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "We've got some visitors here."
  },
  {
    "start": 499.8,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "I don't know how well the camera's"
  },
  {
    "start": 501.0,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "picking them up."
  },
  {
    "start": 517.12,
    "duration": 4.84,
    "text": "But this is our spot, guys. Absolutely"
  },
  {
    "start": 519.2,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "tremendous."
  },
  {
    "start": 522.04,
    "duration": 5.6,
    "text": "Oh, there's the cows away."
  },
  {
    "start": 524.36,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "The very mate talking, Mick."
  },
  {
    "start": 530.24,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "And they thought, \"I'm not listening to"
  },
  {
    "start": 531.28,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "that.\" Lovely good."
  },
  {
    "start": 537.36,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "Just step back a bit there so you can"
  },
  {
    "start": 538.84,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "see."
  },
  {
    "start": 548.92,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "Not a bad spot, eh, for a wild camp,"
  },
  {
    "start": 550.88,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 555.6,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "I'll take guys whilst they're up now."
  },
  {
    "start": 557.68,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Lovely jubbly."
  },
  {
    "start": 559.08,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Little Mick's just opening his first"
  },
  {
    "start": 560.28,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "kind of Budweiser."
  },
  {
    "start": 561.68,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "And I'm going to join him. I'll give you"
  },
  {
    "start": 563.28,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "a quick look, anyway."
  },
  {
    "start": 565.0,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "Have a look at the setup."
  },
  {
    "start": 575.24,
    "duration": 5.04,
    "text": "The key there. Pots and pans are ready."
  },
  {
    "start": 577.56,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "Gus."
  },
  {
    "start": 580.6,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "All set up there. Mix on that side. I've"
  },
  {
    "start": 582.88,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "got the foil down."
  },
  {
    "start": 584.88,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "It's not cold, to be honest. Well, not"
  },
  {
    "start": 586.6,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "yet."
  },
  {
    "start": 588.56,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "I've got plenty snacks for later. Corned"
  },
  {
    "start": 590.4,
    "duration": 6.6,
    "text": "beef pasties, Scotch eggs, Cornish"
  },
  {
    "start": 592.96,
    "duration": 5.72,
    "text": "pasty. Plenty coffees, plenty water."
  },
  {
    "start": 597.0,
    "duration": 6.0,
    "text": "Biscuits."
  },
  {
    "start": 598.68,
    "duration": 6.36,
    "text": "In me bag. We've got Mexican rice."
  },
  {
    "start": 603.0,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Chicken."
  },
  {
    "start": 605.04,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "Mushrooms."
  },
  {
    "start": 606.6,
    "duration": 4.36,
    "text": "Sorted out my mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 608.84,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "We're laughing. Whiskey. What have we"
  },
  {
    "start": 610.96,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "got?"
  },
  {
    "start": 612.08,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "I'll show you."
  },
  {
    "start": 616.04,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "Small bottle of Glenfiddich."
  },
  {
    "start": 618.68,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "I've already done a review on that"
  },
  {
    "start": 620.0,
    "duration": 5.16,
    "text": "before, a couple of year ago. So,"
  },
  {
    "start": 622.64,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "I'll not bother. But, I kept a bit of"
  },
  {
    "start": 625.16,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "this."
  },
  {
    "start": 626.4,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "Hold on."
  },
  {
    "start": 630.64,
    "duration": 5.92,
    "text": "Ardbeg. I think that's how you say it."
  },
  {
    "start": 633.92,
    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "Single malt Scotch whiskey."
  },
  {
    "start": 636.56,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "So, me and Mick"
  },
  {
    "start": 638.08,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "we'll do a review on that."
  },
  {
    "start": 640.52,
    "duration": 2.0,
    "text": "Whiskey."
  },
  {
    "start": 641.36,
    "duration": 5.6,
    "text": "Whiskey."
  },
  {
    "start": 642.52,
    "duration": 7.84,
    "text": "Bottle of beer, Mick. Rough and smooth"
  },
  {
    "start": 646.96,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "at the same time."
  },
  {
    "start": 654.68,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "So, guys, we're going to sit down. We're"
  },
  {
    "start": 656.36,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "going to turn the camera off for a bit."
  },
  {
    "start": 658.08,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "We're going to enjoy a couple of can"
  },
  {
    "start": 659.28,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "dingos, me and the little man dingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 661.96,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 663.96,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "See you in a minute."
  },
  {
    "start": 667.48,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "Hey,"
  },
  {
    "start": 669.04,
    "duration": 5.24,
    "text": "little Mick lad."
  },
  {
    "start": 671.36,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Cheers, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 675.32,
    "duration": 1.84,
    "text": "Cup's big enough, like, innit? Just for"
  },
  {
    "start": 676.6,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "whiskey."
  },
  {
    "start": 677.16,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "Aye."
  },
  {
    "start": 678.8,
    "duration": 5.04,
    "text": "Nice Glenfiddich for me and the little"
  },
  {
    "start": 681.2,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "man dingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 686.72,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Thanks, Mick."
  },
  {
    "start": 689.76,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "Lovely jubly. That's warming us through,"
  },
  {
    "start": 692.0,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 696.04,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 697.52,
    "duration": 5.04,
    "text": "Thanks, guys, for tuning in our first"
  },
  {
    "start": 699.12,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "video of 2022."
  },
  {
    "start": 703.24,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "Just a local one, but"
  },
  {
    "start": 706.6,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "what a fantastic spot."
  },
  {
    "start": 715.08,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "Magic."
  },
  {
    "start": 722.48,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Just want to see it."
  },
  {
    "start": 726.0,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "Thank you for always watching, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 729.8,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "Please leave us a thumbs up. Helps the"
  },
  {
    "start": 731.76,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "channel. You know what I mean, you"
  },
  {
    "start": 733.28,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "mandingos?"
  },
  {
    "start": 736.64,
    "duration": 5.24,
    "text": "And if you haven't already subbed us,"
  },
  {
    "start": 739.12,
    "duration": 5.08,
    "text": "why not? Consider subscribing. It ain't"
  },
  {
    "start": 741.88,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "going to cost you a penny."
  },
  {
    "start": 744.2,
    "duration": 5.08,
    "text": "Hit that subscribe button."
  },
  {
    "start": 746.64,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "If later on down the line you think it's"
  },
  {
    "start": 749.28,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "a load of [\u00a0__\u00a0] or we're a bunch of"
  },
  {
    "start": 750.6,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "tossers, you can unsubscribe. You know"
  },
  {
    "start": 752.6,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "what I mean?"
  },
  {
    "start": 757.56,
    "duration": 1.88,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about, Nick,"
  },
  {
    "start": 758.8,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "don't you?"
  },
  {
    "start": 759.44,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "Like to that."
  },
  {
    "start": 763.04,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "He talks a load of sense."
  },
  {
    "start": 770.48,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "start": 772.36,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "This is the life, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 775.24,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "Anyway, I'm going to sit and chill,"
  },
  {
    "start": 776.88,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "enjoy a few more whiskeys."
  },
  {
    "start": 779.48,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "It's coming in cold now, like, isn't it,"
  },
  {
    "start": 781.52,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "Mick?"
  },
  {
    "start": 782.72,
    "duration": 6.8,
    "text": "I'm feeling me toes getting freezing."
  },
  {
    "start": 786.08,
    "duration": 5.08,
    "text": "So, I think a few more days"
  },
  {
    "start": 789.52,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "we'll go inside."
  },
  {
    "start": 791.16,
    "duration": 4.36,
    "text": "Maybe say Mick a hot drink, warm us"
  },
  {
    "start": 792.84,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "through properly."
  },
  {
    "start": 796.16,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "Cooks up nice food."
  },
  {
    "start": 798.36,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "See you, mandingos, when we get in the"
  },
  {
    "start": 800.2,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "tent."
  },
  {
    "start": 801.52,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "You know what makes sense?"
  },
  {
    "start": 804.0,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "You know what I mean?"
  },
  {
    "start": 805.44,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "You know what Mick's talking about."
  },
  {
    "start": 806.8,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "makes sense? Makes sense."
  },
  {
    "start": 817.08,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about,"
  },
  {
    "start": 818.52,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "text": "mandingos?"
  },
  {
    "start": 819.64,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "Oh, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 820.68,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "Where's little Mick?"
  },
  {
    "start": 824.28,
