  {
    "start": 1344.6,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "professional when the two Chrises is not"
  },
  {
    "start": 1346.56,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "here."
  },
  {
    "start": 1349.32,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about, don't"
  },
  {
    "start": 1350.4,
    "duration": 4.88,
    "text": "you, Mick?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1352.36,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "I like a definite"
  },
  {
    "start": 1356.68,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "dark fruity and and a bit chocolate"
  },
  {
    "start": 1358.48,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "thing going on."
  },
  {
    "start": 1363.32,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1363.88,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "It's really nice though, isn't it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1367.36,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "Well, guys, we'll wrap this up in a"
  },
  {
    "start": 1368.52,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "second."
  },
  {
    "start": 1370.64,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "Cheers again."
  },
  {
    "start": 1374.4,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "Mhm."
  },
  {
    "start": 1376.48,
    "duration": 5.2,
    "text": "Go on, Mick. You get another drink of"
  },
  {
    "start": 1378.8,
    "duration": 6.32,
    "text": "that while I give my score."
  },
  {
    "start": 1381.68,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "Well, I'm going to give that, guys,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1385.4,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "Ardbeg 10"
  },
  {
    "start": 1387.88,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "Speyside"
  },
  {
    "start": 1389.4,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "single malt Scotch whisky."
  },
  {
    "start": 1391.84,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "Do you know what? I'm going to give that"
  },
  {
    "start": 1394.08,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "a massive"
  },
  {
    "start": 1395.72,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "9 out of 10."
  },
  {
    "start": 1397.16,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "And it's not very often we give them"
  },
  {
    "start": 1398.28,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "scores,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1399.4,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "but that is top rank."
  },
  {
    "start": 1402.52,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "What do you reckon, mate?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1404.72,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "I will give that"
  },
  {
    "start": 1406.24,
    "duration": 1.84,
    "text": "8 out of 10."
  },
  {
    "start": 1407.08,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "8?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1408.08,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "That's a brilliant score."
  },
  {
    "start": 1409.88,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "9, 8."
  },
  {
    "start": 1411.64,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "The total score of 8.5."
  },
  {
    "start": 1414.08,
    "duration": 5.64,
    "text": "Now, that is top of the range for the"
  },
  {
    "start": 1415.72,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "Blackoutdoors Show whisky review."
  },
  {
    "start": 1421.44,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "Mhm."
  },
  {
    "start": 1422.76,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "That is really nice. Yeah, I might get a"
  },
  {
    "start": 1424.6,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "bit more."
  },
  {
    "start": 1425.76,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "Well, that's the end of that one, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1427.92,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "Hope you enjoyed it. And if you have,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1429.4,
    "duration": 4.36,
    "text": "remember, give us a thumbs up"
  },
  {
    "start": 1431.76,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "and subscribe. You know what makes"
  },
  {
    "start": 1433.76,
    "duration": 4.84,
    "text": "sense, man dingles?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1435.88,
    "duration": 4.88,
    "text": "I don't believe it does."
  },
  {
    "start": 1438.6,
    "duration": 5.0,
    "text": "Morning, guys. That's me and Mick nearly"
  },
  {
    "start": 1440.76,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "all packed away."
  },
  {
    "start": 1444.08,
    "duration": 5.2,
    "text": "All of our stuff"
  },
  {
    "start": 1446.32,
    "duration": 5.88,
    "text": "I've got in me bag."
  },
  {
    "start": 1449.28,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Nearly sorted."
  },
  {
    "start": 1454.08,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Little Mick's folding the seats up. Good"
  },
  {
    "start": 1456.12,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "one, want it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1457.68,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "Good laugh on it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1458.92,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1463.04,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "All right, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1467.12,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "Bring you back in a second when I've"
  },
  {
    "start": 1468.68,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "took the tent down."
  },
  {
    "start": 1494.8,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "So, that's me and Mick all packed up."
  },
  {
    "start": 1496.44,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "All rubbish in the bags there. Leave no"
  },
  {
    "start": 1498.68,
    "duration": 5.84,
    "text": "trace and all that [\u00a0__\u00a0]"
  },
  {
    "start": 1501.12,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "You can see where the tent's been."
  },
  {
    "start": 1506.68,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "Spot on."
  },
  {
    "start": 1513.72,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "So, that's another one, guys. That's me"
  },
  {
    "start": 1515.16,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "and Mick done."
  },
  {
    "start": 1520.44,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "Another good wild camp, even though it"
  },
  {
    "start": 1522.32,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "was just a local one."
  },
  {
    "start": 1525.88,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "Still something we wanted to do, so now"
  },
  {
    "start": 1527.68,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "it's done."
  },
  {
    "start": 1529.28,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "Anyway, that's it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1530.6,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "I'm just walking out the way cuz there's"
  },
  {
    "start": 1531.84,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "people there."
  },
  {
    "start": 1533.4,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "We will see you on the next one,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1534.92,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "wherever that may be. Probably is"
  },
  {
    "start": 1537.36,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "in the lakes or maybe even up"
  },
  {
    "start": 1538.68,
    "duration": 4.72,
    "text": "Northumberland."
  },
  {
    "start": 1541.24,
    "duration": 5.6,
    "text": "That's about it, mandingos. See you next"
  },
  {
    "start": 1543.4,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "time. Thanks for watching."
  },
  {
    "start": 1546.92,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "Right."
  }
]